<header class="hero" id="home"><div class="wrap"><div class="top"><a class="brand" href="#home"><span class="mark">H</span><span>HASSAN HOSSEINI<br><small style="font-size:9px;color:#b8c8c3;letter-spacing:.2em">CAPITAL & ADVISORY</small></span></a><nav class="nav"><a href="#capabilities" data-i="nav1">Capabilities</a><a href="#sectors" data-i="nav2">Industries</a><a href="#contracts" data-i="nav3">Transactions</a><a href="#leadership" data-i="nav4">Leadership</a><a href="#contact" data-i="nav5">Contact</a></nav><select class="lang" id="language" aria-label="Language"><option value="en">EN</option><option value="fa">فارسی</option><option value="ar">العربية</option></select></div>
<div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow" data-i="eyebrow">STRATEGIC CAPITAL • STRUCTURED FINANCE</div><h1 data-i="heroTitle">Capital that moves<br>ambitious projects forward.</h1><p data-i="heroText">We connect viable projects with capital, structure complex transactions and help investors and project owners move from opportunity to execution—with clarity, discipline and trusted coordination.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="#contact" data-i="cta">Discuss a project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn outline" href="#capabilities" data-i="explore">Explore our capabilities</a></div></div></div></header>
<main>
<section class="section" id="capabilities"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow" data-i="capEyebrow">WHAT WE DO</div><h2 data-i="capTitle">From capital strategy<br>to transaction delivery.</h2></div><p class="lead" data-i="capLead">Our work brings financial structuring, commercial insight and stakeholder coordination together. We shape funding pathways around each project’s stage, risk profile, assets and strategic objectives.</p></div><div class="grid">
<article class="card reveal"><img loading="lazy" src="https://loremflickr.com/3840/2160/office,building" alt="Corporate office"><div class="card-body"><div class="num">01 /</div><h3 data-i="c1t">Project Finance</h3><p data-i="c1p">Funding strategy and financial structuring for capital-intensive developments, from feasibility and bankability review through lender engagement and financial close.</p></div></article>
<article class="card reveal"><img loading="lazy" src="https://loremflickr.com/3840/2160/pipeline" alt="Energy pipeline"><div class="card-body"><div class="num">02 /</div><h3 data-i="c2t">Trade & LC Solutions</h3><p data-i="c2p">Support for documentary letters of credit, trade instruments, supplier payment structures and cross-border commercial transactions, subject to bank and compliance approval.</p></div></article>
<article class="card reveal"><img loading="lazy" src="https://loremflickr.com/3840/2160/construction,crane" alt="Construction project"><div class="card-body"><div class="num">03 /</div><h3 data-i="c3t">Asset-Based Lending</h3><p data-i="c3p">Explore financing against eligible assets, receivables or equipment, with attention to valuation, collateral quality, covenants and repayment capacity.</p></div></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section dark" id="sectors"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow" data-i="sectorEyebrow">SECTOR EXPERIENCE</div><h2 data-i="sectorTitle">Capital for essential<br>real-economy assets.</h2></div><p class="lead" data-i="sectorLead">We engage across sectors where scale, long development cycles and multiple stakeholders make financing more complex—and careful structuring especially important.</p></div><div class="grid">
<article class="card reveal"><img loading="lazy" src="https://loremflickr.com/3840/2160/offshore,platform" alt="Offshore energy platform"><div class="card-body"><div class="num">ENERGY & NATURAL RESOURCES</div><h3 data-i="s1t">Energy, Oil & Gas</h3><p data-i="s1p">Upstream, midstream, downstream and power projects: capital planning, project finance pathways, equipment and infrastructure funding, and coordination among sponsors, operators, suppliers and financiers.</p></div></article>
<article class="card reveal"><img loading="lazy" src="https://loremflickr.com/3840/2160/luxury,apartment" alt="Residential development"><div class="card-body"><div class="num">PROPERTY & INFRASTRUCTURE</div><h3 data-i="s2t">Real Estate & Housing</h3><p data-i="s2p">Residential, commercial and mixed-use developments: development funding, phased capital plans, asset-backed structures and financing strategies aligned with project milestones and cash flows.</p></div></article>
<article class="card reveal"><img loading="lazy" src="https://loremflickr.com/3840/2160/modern,hospital" alt="Modern hospital"><div class="card-body"><div class="num">HEALTHCARE</div><h3 data-i="s3t">Hospitals & Medical Facilities</h3><p data-i="s3p">Hospital construction, expansion and medical equipment: funding plans that consider procurement schedules, operational readiness, long-term demand and the financial sustainability of essential services.</p></div></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div class="photo reveal" style="background-image:url('https://loremflickr.com/3840/2160/engineer,oil')"></div><div class="reveal"><div class="eyebrow" data-i="approachEyebrow">OUR APPROACH</div><h2 data-i="approachTitle">Clear structures.<br>Aligned interests.</h2><p class="lead" data-i="approachText">Every financing opportunity begins with a disciplined understanding of the project: sponsor strength, commercial model, assets, permits, counterparties, projected cash flows and funding gap. We help organize these elements into a coherent transaction narrative, identify suitable financing routes, prepare materials for review and coordinate discussions among project owners, investors, banks, insurers and professional advisers. Our role is to make complex opportunities easier to assess and execute—not to promise financing outcomes. All transactions remain subject to due diligence, eligibility, compliance and final approval by the relevant parties.</p><div class="quote" data-i="quote">“A financeable project is built through credible information, balanced risk allocation and well-defined obligations.”</div></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark" id="contracts"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow" data-i="contractEyebrow">CONTRACTS & TRANSACTION STRUCTURING</div><h2 data-i="contractTitle">The framework behind<br>trusted transactions.</h2><p class="lead" data-i="contractLead">We support the commercial and contractual architecture that allows capital providers and project sponsors to understand their rights, responsibilities, conditions and risk exposure.</p><div class="contract">
<article class="reveal"><h3 data-i="ct1">Term sheets & financing mandates</h3><p data-i="cp1">Clarify scope, proposed structure, fees, milestones, exclusivity where applicable, conditions precedent and the responsibilities of each party before detailed documentation.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><h3 data-i="ct2">Loan & facility documentation</h3><p data-i="cp2">Coordinate review of facility terms, drawdown conditions, repayment schedules, security package, representations, covenants, events of default and information undertakings with qualified legal and financial advisers.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><h3 data-i="ct3">Trade instruments & purchase contracts</h3><p data-i="cp3">Help align commercial contracts, delivery and inspection terms, payment triggers, documentary requirements and applicable trade-finance instruments such as letters of credit.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><h3 data-i="ct4">JV, EPC & project agreements</h3><p data-i="cp4">Support coordination around joint-venture principles, engineering and construction milestones, performance obligations, change procedures, warranties and allocation of project risks.</p></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap band-inner"><h2 data-i="bandTitle">Have a project to fund—or capital to deploy?</h2><a class="btn" href="#contact" data-i="bandCta">Start a conversation ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="section" id="leadership"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow" data-i="leaderEyebrow">LEADERSHIP</div><div class="leader"><div class="initials">HH</div><div><h3><span data-i="leaderFa">سید حسن حسینی</span> <span style="color:var(--gold)">|</span> Hassan Hosseini</h3><p data-i="leaderText">Hassan Hosseini leads the group’s strategic direction and relationship development, bringing together project owners, capital partners and specialist advisers. His focus is on disciplined opportunity assessment, practical financing structures and long-term commercial relationships across energy, real estate, healthcare and trade.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section contact" id="contact"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow" data-i="contactEyebrow">LET’S CONNECT</div><h2 data-i="contactTitle">Tell us what you’re building.</h2><p class="lead" data-i="contactText">Share a few details about your project, funding requirement or investment mandate. Our team can use them to understand the opportunity and identify a suitable next conversation.</p><p><b data-i="contactNote">Confidentiality and eligibility review apply.</b></p></div><form class="form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();alert(document.body.lang==='fa'?'درخواست شما در این نمونه ثبت نمایشی شد. برای دریافت واقعی، فرم باید به ایمیل یا سرور متصل شود.':document.body.lang==='ar'?'تم إرسال النموذج تجريبياً. يلزم ربطه بخادم لاستقبال الطلبات فعلياً.':'Demo form submitted. Connect it to an email or backend to receive inquiries.');"><input required placeholder="Full name" data-ph="name"><input type="email" required placeholder="Business email" data-ph="email"><input placeholder="Company / organization" data-ph="company"><select required><option value="" data-i="select">Area of interest</option><option>Project finance</option><option>Trade finance / LC</option><option>Asset-based lending</option><option>Investment opportunity</option><option>Other</option></select><textarea required placeholder="Briefly describe your project or requirement" data-ph="message"></textarea><button class="btn" type="submit" data-i="send">Submit inquiry ↗</button></form></div></section>
